# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# Referrer-Policy note: this was no-referrer, which stripped the Referer
# header entirely and caused YouTube embed error 153 ("video player
# configuration error") — the player cannot verify its embedding origin
# without it. strict-origin-when-cross-origin sends only the origin
# cross-origin, never the path, so the unlisted URL is still not disclosed.
# The EveryoneSocial pitch page is a private, unlisted, single-recipient page.
# It is linked from nowhere and is not in the sitemap. These headers are the
# authoritative "never index this" signal, stronger than the meta tag alone.

/everyonesocial
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex, notranslate
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/everyonesocial.html
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex, notranslate
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
